# LH Reports
reports/
lighthouse-report.*

# Agent audit and validation reports are the exception to the rule above.
# `reports/` was written for Lighthouse output, but it matches any directory of
# that name at any depth — including `.claude/agents/reports/`, which AGENTS.md
# and CLAUDE.md both name as where validation reports belong. The repository was
# discarding the very artifacts its own docs told agents to write there.
!.claude/agents/reports/

# The July 2026 audit is the one exception to the exception: 45 MB, with single
# full-page screenshots up to 17.8 MB. It predates the decision to keep audit
# output in the repository and has never been tracked. Left out deliberately, so
# that it stays out of `git status` rather than sitting there as noise.
.claude/agents/reports/seo-audit-2026-07-28/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json

